<title>JAPAN: Japan 1996/97 construction orders rise 2.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan 1996/97 construction orders rise 2.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders received by 50 major Japanese construction companies rose 2.9 percent in fiscal 1996/97 from a year earlier to 20.34 trillion yen, the Construction Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
